{"id":16,"course_no":"016","title":"Go 新手入门","summary":"Go是当今流行的开源编程语言之一。它由谷歌开发，用于服务器、网络开发，甚至命令行界面。在本课程中，我们将介绍Go的主要概念，并通过现实场景问题及配套编码挑战带领大家迅速上手Go语言。让我们开始吧!","brief_summary":"交互式学习，轻松有趣无压力，1v1答疑","details":"Go是当今流行的开源编程语言之一。它由谷歌开发，用于服务器、网络开发，甚至命令行界面。在本课程中，我们将介绍Go的主要概念，并通过现实场景问题及配套编码挑战带领大家迅速上手Go语言。让我们开始吧!","cover_img":"/content/assets/34ff01d434148bb3d61d.png","mini_cover_img":"/content/assets/45f283824ad739f65fde.png","mobile_cover_img":"/content/assets/34ff01d434148bb3d61d.png","intro_video_url":null,"target_audience":"beginner","work_mode":"","is_mini":false,"is_educative":false,"is_active":true,"course_type":"sololearn","read_hour":"2.5","rank":22,"language":"golang","mall_cover_img":"/content/assets/087e04316e6ccca9275d.png","mall_cover_v2_img":"/content/assets/4aadbf7e5756faa32cb6.png","learning_points":"学会了Go语言基本概念和语法，了解其在服务器、网络和命令行编程的应用。\r\n\r\n通过实际问题和编码挑战，提高了编程技能和实践经验，能更熟练地使用Go语言进行开发。\r\n\r\n掌握了Go语言的并发编程和内存管理等高级特性，拓展了编程技能。\r\n\r\n学习了现代编程的最佳实践和规范，打下软件开发基础。","share_your_gets":"掌握Golang基础语法，灵活应用\r\n\r\n100+Go语言知识点+练习，巩固加深\r\n\r\n代码挑战，贴近现实，学以致用\r\n\r\n边学边练，轻松有趣，1 v 1答疑","share_sub_title":"零基础，无门槛，交互式，轻松学编程","skills":[],"cates":[7,8],"toc":{"categories":[{"id":83,"seq_no":0,"title":"Go 欢迎你","type":"COLLECTION_CATEGORY","icon_url":"/content/assets/4fb8ab83e4084439707a.png","pages":[{"id":975,"title":"Go 欢迎你","sub_title":"欢迎学习Go！","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[{"id":354,"title":"第一个Go程序","sub_title":"挑战练习","type":"code","edit_mode":false,"is_required":true,"is_preview":false,"challenge":{"challenge_id":354,"title":"第一个Go程序","difficulty":"Easy","points":10,"success_ratio":"0.0%","tags":[],"languages":["Golang"],"status":"undo"},"number":"1.2","status":"undo"}],"number":"1.1","status":"undo"},{"id":976,"title":"包 Package","sub_title":"包 Package","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[],"number":"2.1","status":"lock"},{"id":977,"title":"导入 Import","su